## 5. Drill-Down Flow

### 5.1 System Financial Reports

```
Tab "Tổng quan ngày": click ngày → inline expand game breakdown
Tab "Theo game": click game → navigate /games/{game}/financial-reports
Tab "Theo đại lý": click tenant → inline expand game breakdown per tenant
```

### 5.2 Per-Game Financial Reports (4 cấp)

```
Tab "Theo kỳ quay":
  Cấp 1: settle_draw_reports WHERE financialDate in range
  → Click draw
  Cấp 2: settle_tenant_reports WHERE drawId
  → Click tenant
  Cấp 3: ticket_entries aggregate WHERE {drawId, tenantId} group by accountId
  → Click player
  Cấp 4: ticket_entries WHERE {drawId, tenantId, accountId}
  → Click entry → Dialog chi tiết

Tab "Theo đại lý":
  Cấp 1: settle_tenant_reports aggregate by tenantId
  → Click tenant
  Cấp 2: settle_tenant_reports WHERE {tenantId, financialDate in range} (draw list)
  → Click draw → chuyển sang tab "draws" drill cấp 2+
```

### 5.3 Player/Entry — BẮT BUỘC scope 1 drawId

```
ĐÚNG:  { drawId: "X", tenantId: "Y", status: "settled" } → group by accountId
SAI:   { tenantId: "Y", financialDate: { $gte, $lte } } → group by accountId
```

