## 9. Repository Architecture — Tách Types & Query

**Xem chi tiết đầy đủ tại `mongodb-repository-architecture.mdc`.**

Tóm tắt 3 quy tắc bắt buộc:

1. **Tách types ra `repos/types/`**: File `*-repo.ts` CHỈ chứa class + query logic. Tất cả aggregate result interfaces khai báo trong `repos/types/{concern}.types.ts` riêng. Re-export qua `types/index.ts` → `repos/index.ts`.

2. **KHÔNG MongoDB query trong Use Case**: Use case TUYỆT ĐỐI KHÔNG chứa `$match`, `$group`, `collection.aggregate()`... Mọi DB operations phải đi qua repo method.

3. **KHÔNG gọi Repo trực tiếp từ API Route**: Luồng bắt buộc là **API Route → Use Case → Repository**. API Route chỉ được phép gọi Use Case. Xem `mongodb-repository-architecture.mdc` §3b.

---

## 10. API Route Handlers

**Nguyên tắc bắt buộc: API Route → Use Case → Repository. KHÔNG được bỏ qua Use Case.**

Pattern chuẩn: Next.js Route Handler (GET) → parse params (Zod) → gọi Use Case → return `apiSuccess(result)`.

### Tổ chức Use Cases cho Reports

Tất cả READ use cases cho reports nằm trong `use-cases/reports/` của mỗi application package:

```
packages/game-lotto535-application/src/use-cases/reports/
├── index.ts
├── list-settle-draw-reports.ts      ← GET /api/lotto535/reports/draws
├── get-draw-summary.ts              ← GET /api/lotto535/reports/draws/summary
├── list-draw-tenants.ts             ← GET /api/lotto535/reports/draws/[drawId]/tenants
├── list-tenant-reports.ts           ← GET /api/lotto535/reports/tenants
├── list-tenant-draws.ts             ← GET /api/lotto535/reports/tenants/[tenantId]/draws
├── list-player-breakdown.ts         ← GET /api/lotto535/reports/players
├── list-entry-breakdown.ts          ← GET /api/lotto535/reports/entries
├── list-void-reports.ts             ← GET /api/lotto535/reports/void
└── get-outstanding-reports.ts       ← GET /api/lotto535/reports/outstanding

packages/game-core-application/src/use-cases/reports/
├── index.ts
├── get-daily-overview.ts            ← GET /api/reports/financial/daily
├── get-game-summary.ts              ← GET /api/reports/financial/by-game
