## 11. Repo READ Methods cần thêm

### System repos (game-core-application)

- `SystemSettleGameDailyRepo`: `findByDateRange`, `aggregateByFinancialDate`, `aggregateByGameProduct`
- `SystemSettleTenantDailyRepo`: `aggregateByTenantId`, `findTenantGameBreakdown`
- `SystemOutstandingReportRepo`: `findAll`

### Per-game repos (game-{game}-application)

- `SettleDrawReportRepo`: `findByDateRange`, `aggregateSummary`
- `SettleTenantReportRepo`: `findByDrawId`, `aggregateByTenant`, `findByTenantAndDateRange`
- `VoidReportRepo`: `findByDateRange`
- `OutstandingReportRepo`: `findAll`
- `EntryRepo`: `aggregatePlayersByDrawAndTenant`, `findByDrawTenantPlayer`

Tất cả return types của các method trên → khai báo trong `repos/types/{concern}.types.ts`, **KHÔNG** inline trong repo file (xem `mongodb-repository-architecture.mdc` §2).

